    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic arcade shooters and action games, Pointblank<strong>\u00a0</strong>drops you into a brutal minimalist arena where every enemy has to be taken down with just a single bullet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick it back up, you're going to need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Facing waves of increasingly relentless foes, use powerful augments (and precise aim) to rack up your score and survive just a little longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt on the fly, achieve insane high-scores, and compete on the global leaderboards, with each encounter pushing your reflexes and accuracy to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a single bullet: make sure every shot counts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with 20+ unique augments that help you in your runs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive endless waves of enemies in high-intensity, brutally difficult combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grind for shards to unlock augment pools by killing enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the global leaderboards and compete for the highest score worldwide.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist aesthetic with flat colors and clean visuals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision-based gameplay that rewards quick reflexes and on-the-fly decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic arcade shooters and action games, Pointblank<strong>\u00a0</strong>drops you into a brutal minimalist arena where every enemy has to be taken down with just a single bullet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick it back up, you're going to need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Facing waves of increasingly relentless foes, use powerful augments (and precise aim) to rack up your score and survive just a little longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt on the fly, achieve insane high-scores, and compete on the global leaderboards, with each encounter pushing your reflexes and accuracy to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a single bullet: make sure every shot counts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with 20+ unique augments that help you in your runs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive endless waves of enemies in high-intensity, brutally difficult combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grind for shards to unlock augment pools by killing enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the global leaderboards and compete for the highest score worldwide.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist aesthetic with flat colors and clean visuals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision-based gameplay that rewards quick reflexes and on-the-fly decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Enter a fast-paced arcade shooter with only a single bullet. Obliterate waves of enemies, unlock powerful augments, and make every shot count.",
